{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Refactor `shop/` in three steps:\n1. Extract price formatting into `shop/money.py` with `format_price(cents: int) -> str` and use it from `shop/cart.py`.\n2. Replace the hand-rolled HTTP fetch in `shop/rates.py` with `urllib.request` and make `get_rate(currency)` return a float, with a `RateError` on failure.\n3. Add `Cart.total_in(currency)` that uses `get_rate` and `format_price`.\nAll tests in `tests/` must pass. Add tests for steps 2 and 3."}, "uuid": "4577fc17-1103-49c4-ac32-fac7c4dfdad4", "parentUuid": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:07.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
