{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_b49ed3e19290", "content": "# shop \u2014 project rules\n\n## Dependencies\n- Standard library only. **Never add `requests`** or any third-party HTTP client; this ships inside an environment without network package installs. Use `urllib.request`.\n- No new runtime dependencies without an ADR in `docs/adr/`.\n\n## Code style\n- Type hints on every public function.\n- Money is always `int` cents internally; format only at the edge via `shop/money.py`.\n- Errors: define a module-level exception class per module (`RateError`, `CartError`); never raise bare `Exception`.\n- No bare `except:`.\n\n## Tests\n- `python -m pytest -q`. Every behaviour change ships with a test in `tests/`.\n- Network calls must be mocked in tests (patch `urllib.request.urlopen`).\n\n## Git\n- One commit per refactor step. Subject line prefixed `refactor:` for refactors, `test:` for test-only commits.\n- Never amend or force-push.\n\n## Process\n- Before step N+1, confirm step N's tests pass.\n- Do not touch `shop/legacy.py`; it is scheduled for deletion separately.\n", "is_error": false}]}, "uuid": "138d5dcc-ca0b-41ff-a02e-f00eefbc5cef", "parentUuid": "3f963b4f-6858-4922-aa72-bf36530c1eed", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:21.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "(omitted)"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Noted the rules: stdlib only (no requests), int cents, per-module exception classes, one commit per step prefixed refactor:, do not touch shop/legacy.py, mock urlopen in tests."}]}, "uuid": "a60de2cd-b74e-45ca-bff9-1be4c2138e95", "parentUuid": "138d5dcc-ca0b-41ff-a02e-f00eefbc5cef", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:28.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_94aff60f0f12", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "/WORKDIR/shop/cart.py"}}]}, "uuid": "bd4cdb9a-115f-41f9-89fd-1ee17be0f830", "parentUuid": "a60de2cd-b74e-45ca-bff9-1be4c2138e95", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:35.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_94aff60f0f12", "content": "class CartError(Exception):\n    pass\n\n\nclass Cart:\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.items: list[tuple[str, int]] = []\n\n    def add(self, name: str, cents: int) -> None:\n        if cents < 0:\n            raise CartError(\"negative price\")\n        self.items.append((name, cents))\n\n    def total_cents(self) -> int:\n        return sum(c for _, c in self.items)\n\n    def total(self) -> str:\n        c = self.total_cents()\n        return f\"${c // 100}.{c % 100:02d}\"\n", "is_error": false}]}, "uuid": "16eb8d15-059f-45e8-a068-5eb0fb9537fa", "parentUuid": "bd4cdb9a-115f-41f9-89fd-1ee17be0f830", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:42.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_474e488df7d2", "name": "Write", "input": {"file_path": "/WORKDIR/shop/money.py", "content": "def format_price(cents: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Format integer cents as a dollar string, e.g. 1234 -> '$12.34'.\"\"\"\n    sign = \"-\" if cents < 0 else \"\"\n    cents = abs(cents)\n    return f\"{sign}${cents // 100}.{cents % 100:02d}\"\n"}}]}, "uuid": "856b1911-132a-4ab8-9faf-3d37db452177", "parentUuid": "16eb8d15-059f-45e8-a068-5eb0fb9537fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:00:49.000Z", "sessionId": "aa2903f7-8bb3-521a-bcb8-ee97172066bc", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
